# # /mllde/
#
# https://w3id.org/mllde/ and everything under it redirects to the MLLDE
# xAPI vocabulary & registry. /mllde/profile resolves to the machine-readable
# xAPI Profile (JSON-LD); all other paths resolve to the human-readable registry.
#
# ## Contact
# Ana Eslava-Graterol (Universitat Politecnica de Valencia)
# GitHub username: ProfeAnaEslavaEdTech

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^profile/?$ https://profeanaeslavaedtech.github.io/mllde-xapi/mllde-xapi-profile_v0.8.3.jsonld [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://profeanaeslavaedtech.github.io/mllde-xapi/ [R=302,L]
